266
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:44,388
Now's our chance to escape!

267
00:13:55,140 --> 00:13:57,240
So that's Puppetmon's mansion, huh?

268
00:13:57,820 --> 00:13:59,055
There are two guards.

269
00:14:00,660 --> 00:14:02,880
See who they are. Analyze it.

270
00:14:04,940 --> 00:14:06,352
One of them is Floramon.

271
00:14:06,560 --> 00:14:09,457
She's a plant-type Digimon
who digivolves like a reptile.

272
00:14:09,540 --> 00:14:10,937
Her attack is Rain of Pollen.

273
00:14:11,020 --> 00:14:13,860
And the other guard is... Deramon.

274
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:16,357
At first glance, it looks
like a bird-type Digimon,

275
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:18,777
but it's actually got a plant
growing out of its back.

276
00:14:18,860 --> 00:14:19,690
Prodigious.

277
00:14:19,773 --> 00:14:21,217
So they're not ultimate Digimon, right?

278
00:14:21,300 --> 00:14:22,130
Right.

279
00:14:22,213 --> 00:14:23,837
Nonetheless, we should be careful.

280
00:14:23,920 --> 00:14:25,477
They could be quite dangerous.

281
00:14:25,560 --> 00:14:27,840
Shall we go? Wait! Hmm?

282
00:14:28,140 --> 00:14:30,137
There might be more guards inside.

283
00:14:30,220 --> 00:14:32,357
I'll go inside and make
sure the coast is clear.

284
00:14:32,440 --> 00:14:34,237
You guys wait here until I get back.

285
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:36,557
Tai, I think Patamon and
I should go with you.

286
00:14:36,640 --> 00:14:39,857
After all, we're the only ones who
know where everything is inside there.

287
00:14:39,940 --> 00:14:40,770
Right!

288
00:14:40,853 --> 00:14:42,277
Sorry, it might be dangerous.

289
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:44,817
Come on, Tai, don't treat
me like a little kid.

290
00:14:44,900 --> 00:14:45,730
That's not it.

291
00:14:45,813 --> 00:14:47,720
What if we go together, as a team?

292
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:48,900
I vote with Kari.

293
00:14:49,380 --> 00:14:51,877
There's nothing to be afraid
of if we all go together.

294
00:14:51,960 --> 00:14:52,917
What do we do, Tai?

295
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:53,830
You decide.

296
00:14:53,913 --> 00:14:54,743
All right, everyone.

297
00:14:54,826 --> 00:14:56,600
We're going. Follow me.

298
