337
00:16:28,560 --> 00:16:30,031
Oh, yeah, now I remember.

338
00:16:30,240 --> 00:16:33,057
Puppetmon doesn't have any friends,
even though he thinks he does.

339
00:16:33,140 --> 00:16:34,258
Yeah, that's right.

340
00:16:34,400 --> 00:16:37,957
Wow, what could be worse than having
